      "text": "Given features of a training dataset $\\mathbf{X}$ and corresponding (known) labels $\\mathbf{y}$, the goal of linear regression is to find the weight vector $\\mathbf{w}$ and the bias term $b$ such that, given features of a new data example sampled from the same distribution as $\\mathbf{X}$, the new example's label will (in expectation) be predicted with the smallest error."
